  "version": "0.21.44",
  "notes": "Phone app: one Studio menu that follows your finger, with a settings wheel (edge, position, width); new widgets (Teach & Stop, Player, Phone controls) and the Wizard's Kit; zoom and a layout lock in the corner; the Hub is customizable with an Autopilot switch and live mirror; Teach no longer times out. Every mirror glows white at rest, red while teaching, green while Falcor plays. Easier Recent/Home/Back taps. The firewall rule adds itself.",
